WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.873
Now suppose your account has a dip before climbing back up—do you share profits while you

2
00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:06.516
are just getting back to even?

3
00:00:06.516 --> 00:00:06.844
Never.

4
00:00:06.844 --> 00:00:11.881
Think of your High-Water Mark like a pencil line on a doorframe marking your tallest height.

5
00:00:11.881 --> 00:00:16.864
Try entering a prior drawdown right now and watch the shared buckets drop to zero until you

6
00:00:16.864 --> 00:00:17.904
pass your old peak.
